    "Prior history found (~/.screenpipe). It will move text and metadata (moments, windows, URLs, transcripts with speakers) into ZBS Eye's memory — search will work across all your old history. Media files stay where they are. You can interrupt and continue later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
